# Build
# Database
# Database dumps (may contain production data)
# Environment variables and secrets
# Generated exports
# IDE
# Local agent/editor settings
# Node
# OS
# Playwright artifacts
# Python
# Secret keys and credentials
# Source/test modules whose filenames contain "secret"/"token" but are code,
# Temporary files
# Testing
# UI capture reference (large binary screenshots + index doc) — not app code
# generated analysis artifacts / local run outputs
# jscpd reports (generated)
# not secret material. The broad patterns above would otherwise leave them
# untracked, breaking imports/tests on a fresh checkout (e.g. CI).
